WEBVTT

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.550
Save Your Mother, Ikuto

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.550
Hagurumon's Cage

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:08.230
Save Your Mother, Ikuto!

00:00:08.230 --> 00:00:09.550
Hagurumon's Cage!

00:00:10.670 --> 00:00:15.970
Under Satsuma's command, Masaru and the others went to the Japanese Alps to meet Ikuto's parents.

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:25.450
However, Gotsumon, who should have come to take Ikuto back, betrayed him instead and attacked.

00:00:28.390 --> 00:00:34.380
No longer with a home to return to, Ikuto could only weep inside the forest.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:41.670
Is that Ikuto's house?

00:00:41.670 --> 00:00:42.660
Yeah.

00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:43.680
How about it?

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:45.540
Does this place look familiar to you?

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:50.000
The event was ten years ago.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:51.990
How can he remember that far back?

00:00:51.990 --> 00:00:54.010
I can remember!

00:00:54.010 --> 00:00:56.650
Ten years ago, I fell from the monkey bars once.

00:00:56.650 --> 00:00:59.000
Look, you can still see my scar!

00:01:00.290 --> 00:01:02.480
I don't care what happened to you!

00:01:02.480 --> 00:01:03.720
Let's get down to work!

00:01:08.060 --> 00:01:09.600
Maybe they're out...

00:01:11.630 --> 00:01:14.490
Aniki! I think there's someone over there!

00:01:14.490 --> 00:01:15.640
Okay, let's go!

00:01:15.640 --> 00:01:17.160
Wait a minute!

00:01:21.210 --> 00:01:23.770
Look, aren't they pretty?

00:01:23.770 --> 00:01:26.440
So many flowers have bloomed this year.

00:01:26.440 --> 00:01:30.130
I'll put them all into vases and make your room look like a garden, okay?

00:01:38.550 --> 00:01:39.380
Ikuto!

00:01:52.830 --> 00:01:53.640
That was...

00:01:53.640 --> 00:01:55.300
Watch out!

00:02:00.010 --> 00:02:01.610
Oh, what are you doing?

00:02:01.610 --> 00:02:02.530
Yoshino!

00:02:05.440 --> 00:02:06.930
We're going ahead!

00:02:08.360 --> 00:02:09.700
Hey, wait!

00:02:09.700 --> 00:02:11.380
Are you from DATS?

00:02:12.220 --> 00:02:14.200
Yes, but... who are you?

00:02:15.190 --> 00:02:17.540
I'm Noguchi Kenji.

00:02:17.540 --> 00:02:19.500
Ikuto's father.

00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:20.800
Father?

00:02:22.290 --> 00:02:25.280
I've heard about the situation from Satsuma-san...

00:02:25.280 --> 00:02:26.980
That Ikuto was found...

00:02:26.980 --> 00:02:31.290
He was raised as a Digimon in the Digital World.

00:02:31.290 --> 00:02:34.780
Even now, he's convinced that he's a Digimon.

00:02:34.780 --> 00:02:36.790
I see...

00:02:36.790 --> 00:02:39.400
It's true that he's alive...

00:02:42.130 --> 00:02:45.280
Knowing that is enough.

00:02:45.280 --> 00:02:47.360
Please leave now.

00:02:47.810 --> 00:02:49.040
Why?!

00:03:50.810 --> 00:03:52.830
This happened ten years ago.

00:03:52.830 --> 00:04:00.070
My wife and I, who were studying the Digital Gate from here, did something that cost us what we could not recover.

00:04:26.450 --> 00:04:27.590
Ikuto!

00:04:27.590 --> 00:04:28.390
Look out!

00:04:29.800 --> 00:04:30.600
Ikuto!

00:04:30.770 --> 00:04:33.140
Ikuto!!

00:04:35.570 --> 00:04:36.640
Ikuto...

00:04:38.050 --> 00:04:41.020
No!!!

00:04:43.050 --> 00:04:48.780
Ikuto, who was still an infant, was taken to the other side of the Digital Gate.

00:04:49.310 --> 00:04:56.090
Later on, we participated in the Digital World Exploration Squad in order to find him...

00:04:59.700 --> 00:05:05.800
but all we found was this robot that Ikuto would always play with.

00:05:06.390 --> 00:05:13.460
The wound in our hearts, especially my wife, Misuzu's, was very deep.

00:05:13.460 --> 00:05:17.110
She even stopped talking to other people for a while.

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:28.400
Now ten years later, with our daughter's birth, her emotional wounds are finally beginning to heal.

00:05:28.400 --> 00:05:33.840
If she knew about Ikuto now, Misuzu will surely relapse into distress.

00:05:33.840 --> 00:05:38.330
I don't want her to be hurt anymore.

00:05:38.330 --> 00:05:42.090
So please, leave this place.

00:05:42.590 --> 00:05:44.300
Don't say such selfish crap!

00:05:44.750 --> 00:05:49.820
Ikuto's lived all alone, not even knowing what you guys looked like!

00:05:49.820 --> 00:05:53.260
You call yourselves his parents?!

00:05:53.260 --> 00:05:56.990
What was that stuff about "I don't want my wife to be hurt?!"

00:05:56.990 --> 00:06:00.740
When she's hurt, you live together sharing the pain!

00:06:00.740 --> 00:06:02.490
Isn't that what a family does?!

00:06:03.510 --> 00:06:05.270
You don't know anything...

00:06:06.900 --> 00:06:11.700
You don't know how long she's kept on blaming herself for losing Ikuto!

00:06:12.870 --> 00:06:15.160
Honey, are you back?

00:06:15.160 --> 00:06:16.870
Have you brought guests?

00:06:17.230 --> 00:06:18.830
Oh, no!

00:06:19.820 --> 00:06:24.400
I haven't told Misuzu about this news yet.

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:26.800
So I beg of you. Please, leave for today...

00:06:29.930 --> 00:06:31.750
Let's go, Aniki...

00:06:31.750 --> 00:06:33.010
Fine!

00:06:33.010 --> 00:06:34.700
Sorry for the intrusion!

00:06:43.220 --> 00:06:44.430
Ikuto...

00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:48.400
Don't you want to meet her?

00:06:48.400 --> 00:06:51.540
That person could be your mom.

00:06:51.540 --> 00:06:52.640
Wrong!

00:06:52.640 --> 00:06:55.130
My mother only Yukidarumon!

00:06:55.130 --> 00:06:56.960
Do you really think so?

00:06:56.960 --> 00:06:57.720
What?

00:06:57.720 --> 00:07:00.110
Didn't you feel it, too?

00:07:00.920 --> 00:07:03.570
At the very least, I felt it.

00:07:03.570 --> 00:07:07.770
That person's hair and eye color, the way she laughed...

00:07:07.770 --> 00:07:09.300
It all felt just like you...

00:07:08.820 --> 00:07:09.980
Shut up!

00:07:11.760 --> 00:07:13.220
Ikuto...

00:07:13.600 --> 00:07:17.430
Did you forget what humans did?!

00:07:18.960 --> 00:07:20.010
Ikuto...

00:07:20.370 --> 00:07:21.140
Ikuto...!

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:25.610
I can't go any further. This is farewell.

00:07:25.610 --> 00:07:28.130
Run away quickly, you two!

00:07:28.130 --> 00:07:29.790
I don't want to!

00:07:29.790 --> 00:07:32.500
We take Yukidarumon with us!

00:07:39.460 --> 00:07:41.710
Listen to me carefully, Ikuto.

00:07:41.710 --> 00:07:47.110
A sad and painful fate may be in store for you from now on.

00:07:47.110 --> 00:07:50.920
But Ikuto... you must never hate the humans...

00:07:51.710 --> 00:07:54.510
Because, you are...

00:07:55.410 --> 00:07:56.720
Mom...

00:07:57.360 --> 00:07:58.500
Mom!

00:08:02.540 --> 00:08:05.230
MOM!!!

00:08:08.790 --> 00:08:10.860
Humans... enemies!

00:08:10.860 --> 00:08:13.570
I never forgive humans ever!

00:08:13.810 --> 00:08:15.100
Ikuto...

00:08:15.930 --> 00:08:17.490
Come along, Falcomon.

00:08:18.230 --> 00:08:22.000
I show them that that woman is not my mother!

00:08:25.220 --> 00:08:26.370
Ikuto...

00:08:32.380 --> 00:08:33.300
Ikuto...

00:08:41.920 --> 00:08:43.110
This can't be...

00:08:43.110 --> 00:08:43.980
Honey!

00:08:44.330 --> 00:08:46.050
Misuzu! Don't come any closer!

00:08:46.050 --> 00:08:47.300
Why?

00:08:47.300 --> 00:08:50.620
The Digital Gate's finally opened again after ten years!

00:08:50.620 --> 00:08:53.870
Ikuto might be coming back to us!

00:08:53.870 --> 00:08:54.780
Misuzu...

00:08:57.500 --> 00:08:58.320
Ikuto!

00:09:03.450 --> 00:09:12.880
Hagurumon

00:09:03.450 --> 00:09:12.880
Child Level

00:09:04.150 --> 00:09:05.040
Hagurumon.

00:09:05.040 --> 00:09:07.620
A Child Level Digimon shaped like a gear.

00:09:07.620 --> 00:09:09.710
His attack is Darkness Gear.

00:09:09.710 --> 00:09:12.900
He uses black gears, which dig into his enemies, to control them.

00:09:13.180 --> 00:09:14.730
Darkness Gear!

00:09:26.450 --> 00:09:27.300
Oh no!

00:09:42.010 --> 00:09:43.050
Over here!

00:09:56.900 --> 00:09:57.800
Misuzu!

00:09:57.800 --> 00:09:58.430
Quickly!

00:09:58.970 --> 00:10:00.930
Honey! Please, take care of Yuka!

00:10:00.930 --> 00:10:02.910
You, too! Quickly!

00:10:04.510 --> 00:10:05.770
Misuzu!

00:10:06.020 --> 00:10:07.460
Don't worry about me!

00:10:07.460 --> 00:10:09.940
Honey, take care of Yuka!

00:10:10.680 --> 00:10:12.010
Misuzu!!

00:10:26.620 --> 00:10:28.170
This is the worst.

00:10:28.170 --> 00:10:29.460
Hey!

00:10:28.170 --> 00:10:29.460
Hey!

00:10:31.470 --> 00:10:32.630
Where are Ikuto and Falcomon?

00:10:33.630 --> 00:10:34.840
Nowhere to be found.

00:10:35.800 --> 00:10:37.180
What about Falcomon's Digimon signal?

00:10:37.180 --> 00:10:41.490
Maybe it's because of the thunder, but I can't trace him anywhere.

00:10:41.490 --> 00:10:44.050
Can't we just ask Tohma to help us?

00:10:45.480 --> 00:10:46.900
You've got to be kidding!

00:10:46.900 --> 00:10:50.690
Think about what'll happen if we told headquarters we lost sight of Ikuto!

00:10:51.020 --> 00:10:52.190
YOU IDIOTS!

00:10:54.530 --> 00:10:58.270
...and the Captain's furious thunder will definitely fall upon us.

00:10:58.270 --> 00:10:59.540
Th-That's true.

00:10:59.540 --> 00:11:01.220
HQ to Yoshino.

00:11:01.220 --> 00:11:02.400
Speak of the devil...

00:11:02.400 --> 00:11:04.240
Yoshino, calm down!

00:11:05.570 --> 00:11:06.330
Yoshino here.

00:11:06.860 --> 00:11:11.630
A new Digimon signal has appeared at point K90.

00:11:11.630 --> 00:11:13.290
Go there immediately.

00:11:14.060 --> 00:11:16.660
Point K90...

00:11:16.660 --> 00:11:19.630
That's where Ikuto's parents' house is!

00:11:19.630 --> 00:11:21.720
Damn! What's going on over there?

00:11:26.120 --> 00:11:27.220
What's that?

00:11:28.910 --> 00:11:29.640
That's...

00:11:29.640 --> 00:11:30.890
Hagurumon!

00:11:33.920 --> 00:11:37.860
Did he also come here to kill me, under Gotsumon's orders?

00:11:41.450 --> 00:11:42.790
I don't think so.

00:11:43.550 --> 00:11:47.750
Hagurumon is really stubborn, so he never lets anyone order him around.

00:11:47.750 --> 00:11:49.490
Yukidarumon always said so.

00:11:50.190 --> 00:11:51.700
Then... why?

00:11:52.000 --> 00:11:54.170
Maybe it was an accident.

00:11:54.790 --> 00:11:59.890
In other words, a Digital Gate could've opened up on its own and he went through it into the human world.

00:11:59.890 --> 00:12:00.130
Yeah.

00:12:00.490 --> 00:12:02.350
You! When did you...?

00:12:02.350 --> 00:12:03.630
Hey!

00:12:03.630 --> 00:12:05.370
Save her!

00:12:07.150 --> 00:12:09.630
Misuzu is still in there!

00:12:11.020 --> 00:12:12.350
What did you say?

00:12:12.350 --> 00:12:13.870
She's imprisoned!

00:12:13.870 --> 00:12:15.190
I beg of you!

00:12:15.190 --> 00:12:16.150
Save her!

00:12:18.600 --> 00:12:19.500
Let's go, Agumon!

00:12:19.500 --> 00:12:20.210
Yeah!

00:12:30.440 --> 00:12:32.370
Baby Burner!

00:12:30.940 --> 00:12:32.370
Nuts Shoot!

00:12:35.080 --> 00:12:37.360
Mama, where are you?

00:12:38.020 --> 00:12:38.840
What?

00:12:38.840 --> 00:12:43.300
Don't leave me. Don't leave me alone.

00:12:43.650 --> 00:12:45.170
What's going on?

00:12:45.780 --> 00:12:47.310
HQ to Yoshino-san.

00:12:47.310 --> 00:12:47.800
Tohma?

00:12:48.530 --> 00:12:51.510
Strong thought energy is emitting from that Digimon.

00:12:51.920 --> 00:12:54.070
Thought energy?

00:12:54.070 --> 00:12:57.230
Do you remember what I've mentioned to you before?

00:12:57.230 --> 00:13:01.150
Digimon rampage under the effect of human desires.

00:13:02.190 --> 00:13:05.910
That Hagurumon is no different. Under the influence of someone's strong feelings, it's possible that

00:13:02.910 --> 00:13:03.740
Mama...

00:13:04.570 --> 00:13:05.490
Mama...

00:13:05.910 --> 00:13:09.550
he's synchronized with those emotions, which is what's causing him to rampage.

00:13:06.560 --> 00:13:07.400
Mama...

00:13:11.100 --> 00:13:12.820
Someone's feelings...

00:13:14.130 --> 00:13:17.350
Ikuto, do you recognize that thing?

00:13:20.010 --> 00:13:21.030
Mama...

00:13:23.300 --> 00:13:23.960
It can't be...

00:13:25.230 --> 00:13:26.530
Yeah.

00:13:26.530 --> 00:13:30.390
It's the robot you used to play with when you were a baby.

00:13:31.460 --> 00:13:32.430
Mama...

00:13:32.640 --> 00:13:33.350
Mama...

00:13:35.310 --> 00:13:38.030
No way! That was ten years ago.

00:13:38.030 --> 00:13:40.580
There's no way he remembers.

00:13:41.740 --> 00:13:42.620
Mama...

00:13:52.620 --> 00:13:54.180
Mama!

00:13:53.350 --> 00:13:54.410
Mama...

00:13:54.960 --> 00:13:55.960
No way!

00:13:55.960 --> 00:13:56.870
You remember?

00:13:57.640 --> 00:14:01.580
That thing's raging under the influence of your feelings.

00:14:01.820 --> 00:14:02.890
Mama!

00:14:02.890 --> 00:14:04.840
Where are you, Mama?

00:14:04.840 --> 00:14:06.510
My... feelings...

00:14:07.070 --> 00:14:09.480
Where are you, Mama?!

00:14:14.190 --> 00:14:14.930
You're lying!

00:14:15.810 --> 00:14:16.890
I am Digimon!

00:14:16.890 --> 00:14:19.600
My mother only Yukidarumon!

00:14:21.240 --> 00:14:23.990
Don't try to trick your own feelings!

00:14:23.990 --> 00:14:25.280
Aniki?

00:14:25.880 --> 00:14:32.200
Even if you've never seen their faces, children can't erase their feelings for their parents.

00:14:33.580 --> 00:14:38.200
When you're their child... when you're human, it's only natural!

00:14:41.340 --> 00:14:42.840
That's right!

00:14:42.840 --> 00:14:43.970
Residual emotion!

00:14:44.540 --> 00:14:46.120
There's a possibility!

00:14:46.120 --> 00:14:52.260
That robot may have remnants of Ikuto's powerful feelings clung to it when he was a baby...

00:14:47.140 --> 00:14:48.160
Mama!

00:14:49.090 --> 00:14:50.260
Mama!

00:14:55.510 --> 00:14:56.680
Mama!

00:14:57.610 --> 00:14:59.770
Where's Mama?

00:15:03.760 --> 00:15:04.770
Let's go, Ikuto...

00:15:04.770 --> 00:15:06.980
and save your mother!

00:15:22.980 --> 00:15:23.710
All right!

00:15:24.190 --> 00:15:25.520
Strong as always, Aniki!

00:15:25.520 --> 00:15:26.900
Let's go, Agumon!

00:15:27.970 --> 00:15:29.170
Digisoul...

00:15:32.990 --> 00:15:34.420
Full Charge!

00:15:38.520 --> 00:15:40.050
Agumon, evolve!

00:15:57.980 --> 00:15:59.490
RiseGreymon!

00:16:04.140 --> 00:16:05.180
Mama!

00:16:26.790 --> 00:16:27.550
That's...!

00:16:27.550 --> 00:16:28.230
Misuzu!

00:16:29.120 --> 00:16:31.230
We can't attack with her in there!

00:16:43.930 --> 00:16:44.910
Ikuto!

00:16:44.910 --> 00:16:46.080
You can do it!

00:16:46.080 --> 00:16:47.740
Go, Ikuto!

00:16:47.740 --> 00:16:50.900
No one but you can save your mother!

00:16:53.640 --> 00:16:54.770
Mom...

00:16:55.990 --> 00:16:58.160
Ikuto, hold onto me!

00:16:58.160 --> 00:16:58.870
Falcomon!

00:16:58.870 --> 00:16:59.910
Let's go!

00:17:08.940 --> 00:17:09.870
Mom!

00:17:22.280 --> 00:17:24.290
Okay! Now, RiseGreymon!

00:17:25.270 --> 00:17:26.850
Trident Revolver!

00:17:37.210 --> 00:17:38.340
Misuzu!

00:17:40.010 --> 00:17:41.500
Honey...

00:17:44.180 --> 00:17:45.120
Yuka...

00:17:45.950 --> 00:17:46.950
Misuzu...

00:17:54.070 --> 00:17:54.940
Ikuto?

00:17:56.810 --> 00:17:58.310
You're Ikuto, right?

00:18:00.120 --> 00:18:03.330
Please... show me your face!

00:18:03.900 --> 00:18:04.830
Ikuto!

00:18:07.540 --> 00:18:09.960
You came back...

00:18:11.170 --> 00:18:13.490
Thank goodness...

00:18:30.730 --> 00:18:33.020
Professor Noguchi.

00:18:33.020 --> 00:18:36.730
You are under arrest for violating the laws of the Ministry of Confidentiality.

00:18:37.180 --> 00:18:38.910
Governor Hashiba?

00:18:38.910 --> 00:18:40.220
What do you mean?

00:18:40.220 --> 00:18:44.720
Not only did you have illegal possession of a Digimon, but you've experimented with opening the Digital Gate.

00:18:44.720 --> 00:18:46.380
Oh, but there's more!

00:18:46.380 --> 00:18:49.620
You've also been caught doing secret research on the Digital World.

00:18:50.220 --> 00:18:51.360
Wait a minute!

00:18:51.360 --> 00:18:52.540
We have nothing to do with...!

00:18:52.540 --> 00:18:55.300
Are you claiming you did nothing?

00:18:55.300 --> 00:19:00.590
Even after that Digimon appeared from your labs and destroyed your house?

00:19:00.590 --> 00:19:01.600
That's because...

00:19:01.600 --> 00:19:03.000
Please wait!

00:19:03.000 --> 00:19:04.470
Kenji-san is innocent!

00:19:04.470 --> 00:19:07.610
What are you saying, Mrs. Noguchi?

00:19:07.610 --> 00:19:11.130
That <i>you</i>  are the culprit this time?

00:19:11.130 --> 00:19:12.140
Don't be absurd!

00:19:12.140 --> 00:19:15.230
We'll listen to all of your excuses later.

00:19:15.230 --> 00:19:17.110
Hey! Arrest her!

00:19:19.190 --> 00:19:20.220
Stop!

00:19:20.220 --> 00:19:21.570
Misuzu did nothing wrong!

00:19:21.570 --> 00:19:23.430
You bastards are playing dirty!

00:19:23.430 --> 00:19:25.420
There's got to be a misunderstanding!

00:19:25.420 --> 00:19:26.680
Let her go!

00:19:27.880 --> 00:19:28.740
STOP IT!

00:19:31.140 --> 00:19:33.340
Don't get the wrong idea!

00:19:33.340 --> 00:19:38.780
The one who opened the Digital Gate and destroyed their house is me...

00:19:38.780 --> 00:19:41.510
the Digital World's warrior, Ikuto-sama!

00:19:41.510 --> 00:19:42.380
Ikuto?

00:19:41.510 --> 00:19:42.380
Ikuto?

00:19:42.660 --> 00:19:44.130
Ikuto?

00:19:44.550 --> 00:19:47.050
You can't mean the Noguchi couple's only son?

00:19:47.470 --> 00:19:48.700
Wrong!

00:19:48.700 --> 00:19:51.040
I'm not their child!

00:19:51.040 --> 00:19:54.560
I'm Digimon of justice who come to destroy foolish humans!

00:19:56.340 --> 00:19:58.150
That one is also guilty.

00:19:58.150 --> 00:19:59.310
Seize him!

00:19:59.920 --> 00:20:01.390
Uchitake Otoshi!

00:20:04.040 --> 00:20:04.890
Ikuto!

00:20:04.890 --> 00:20:06.710
Falcomon is gone, too!

00:20:06.710 --> 00:20:08.620
Don't let him escape! Find him!

00:20:08.620 --> 00:20:10.560
Seize him!!

00:20:11.490 --> 00:20:12.620
Ikuto...

00:20:13.820 --> 00:20:14.870
Ikuto!

00:20:14.870 --> 00:20:15.580
Damn it!

00:20:21.880 --> 00:20:23.090
What?

00:20:23.090 --> 00:20:25.220
Ikuto has betrayed us?

00:20:25.220 --> 00:20:26.450
Yes.

00:20:26.450 --> 00:20:29.180
While I was searching for him in earnest, not only did he ignore me...

00:20:29.180 --> 00:20:33.890
but he joined the human side and attacked me!

00:20:34.900 --> 00:20:36.350
I don't believe it.

00:20:37.060 --> 00:20:39.860
Truth! It's the truth!

00:20:40.330 --> 00:20:42.170
After all, he is a human!

00:20:42.170 --> 00:20:44.920
His existence is incompatible with ours.

00:20:46.450 --> 00:20:53.820
Mercurimon-sama, would it not be best to go to the human world at once and destroy it to pieces?

00:20:53.820 --> 00:20:55.250
No.

00:20:55.250 --> 00:20:56.670
W-Why?

00:20:57.150 --> 00:21:01.450
If we fall into war, our allies will also suffer casualties.

00:21:01.450 --> 00:21:03.710
Now is not the time for that.

00:21:04.140 --> 00:21:05.300
But...

00:21:08.700 --> 00:21:10.810
Are you getting cold feet, Mercurimon?

00:21:12.010 --> 00:21:18.980
I can't believe such cowardly words were uttered by the man who had once ruled the Digital World's woodlands.

00:21:25.190 --> 00:21:28.660
You are... SaberLeomon!

00:21:28.940 --> 00:21:32.360
It's been a long time, my friend.

